Frontend Software Engineer

Job Title: Frontend Software Engineer
Experience: 2–5 Years
Employment Type: Full-Time

Job Description

We are looking for a Frontend Software Engineer to build responsive, scalable, and user-friendly web applications. The ideal candidate should have strong JavaScript/TypeScript fundamentals and hands-on experience with modern frontend frameworks.

Responsibilities
Develop responsive and reusable web application components.
Build interactive user interfaces using React, Angular, or Vue.js.
Integrate frontend applications with RESTful APIs.
Implement state management and application-level data flows.
Optimize frontend applications for performance and scalability.
Write clean, maintainable, and reusable code.
Develop unit and integration tests for frontend components.
Debug browser, API, and application-level issues.
Collaborate with backend engineers, designers, QA, and product teams.
Ensure cross-browser and responsive compatibility.
Participate in code reviews and contribute to frontend architecture decisions.
Required Skills
Strong knowledge of HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and TypeScript.
Hands-on experience with React.js, Angular, or Vue.js.
Experience consuming REST APIs.
Knowledge of state management such as Redux, Context API, NgRx, or equivalent.
Understanding of responsive web design.
Experience with Git and version control.
Knowledge of frontend testing frameworks.
Understanding of browser fundamentals and web performance.
Strong understanding of asynchronous programming and JavaScript concepts.
Preferred Skills
Next.js or similar frameworks.
React Testing Library/Jest/Cypress.
Webpack/Vite.
Accessibility standards.
Docker and CI/CD.
Basic backend/API knowledge.